      "description": "We are experiencing issues with the MFA flow in the Payment Gateway v2 staging environment (US-East). When users attempt to log in, the MFA prompt is not appearing at all. For those who managed to get a prompt, the codes are being rejected as invalid. This is affecting about 14 of our test users and blocking further testing of the payment flow."
