      "title": "Critical: Billing Engine unresponsive with 502 errors",
      "description": "Our production Billing Engine in US-West is completely down. We are seeing HTTP 502 errors, the service is unresponsive, and users are getting certificate warnings. This is impacting over 3000 users right now. We are sure this is caused by an idempotency failure where duplicate requests are clogging up the queue."
    },
    {
      "i": 6737,
      "title": "Chargeback notices received for Currency Converter transactions",
